@ApiAggregator_HostAddress = http://localhost:5125

### Basic search across all available sources
GET {{ApiAggregator_HostAddress}}/api/aggregation?Query=apollo
Accept: application/json

### Restrict to specific sources
GET {{ApiAggregator_HostAddress}}/api/aggregation?Query=apollo&Sources=GitHub&Sources=Nasa
Accept: application/json

### Filter by category and date range, sorted by title
GET {{ApiAggregator_HostAddress}}/api/aggregation?Query=apollo&Category=Repository&FromDate=2024-01-01&ToDate=2026-08-01&SortBy=Title&SortDirection=Ascending
Accept: application/json

### Invalid: FromDate later than ToDate (expect 400)
GET {{ApiAggregator_HostAddress}}/api/aggregation?Query=apollo&FromDate=2026-08-01&ToDate=2026-01-01
Accept: application/json

### Invalid: source and category that don't match (expect 400)
GET {{ApiAggregator_HostAddress}}/api/aggregation?Query=apollo&Sources=GitHub&Category=Article
Accept: application/json

### Request statistics per external API
GET {{ApiAggregator_HostAddress}}/api/aggregation/statistics
Accept: application/json
